                                        <h3>How much should a kidswear brand spend on marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>Early-stage (₹5-15 lakh monthly revenue): ₹1.5-4 lakh / month (roughly 25-30% of revenue). Growth-stage: 18-22% of revenue. Scaling brands optimise to 12-16% of revenue.</p>
                                        <h3>What is a healthy CAC for a kidswear D2C brand?</h3>
